  "configuration_id": "config_032",
  "reason": "The strongest evidence is RNA-only multiprofile with scvi_n200, where transformer aggregation is best (config_006: 0.653 accuracy / 0.628 F1) and avgpool is close (config_005: 0.650 / 0.628). The only multimodal test so far, config_030 (scvi_n200 + resnet50, multiprofile, avgpool, concat), underperformed RNA-only (0.632 / 0.607), leaving uncertainty about whether image can help or whether avgpool/concat was limiting. config_032 keeps the same RNA encoder, profile setting, image encoder, and fusion as config_030 but changes aggregation to transformer, directly testing whether transformer aggregation improves the multimodal model and whether adding image to the best RNA-only transformer setup can beat config_006. This is a controlled exploitation of the most promising RNA direction and a high-value next step before adding further fusion or image-encoder complexity."
}

